9
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.061
Nehru, Tito and Nasser,

10
00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:21.607
with Sukarno and Nkrumah.

11
00:00:21.957 --> 00:00:24.535
Nehru stressed it wasn't neutrality.

12
00:00:24.535 --> 00:00:25.914
It was the freedom to

13
00:00:25.914 --> 00:00:27.406
judge each issue on its

14
00:00:27.406 --> 00:00:28.395
